<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta http-equiv="CONTENT-TYPE" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title> Support &bull; SweetDreams AI </title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/donate.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,200..1000;1,200..1000&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&family=Quicksand:wght@300..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

  <div class="nav__container">
    <section class="menu__links__section" id="menu__links__section">
      <button class="close__btn" id="close__btn" alt="Close">
        <img src="/icons/close.svg" />
      </button>

        <a href="/"> &bull; Home </a>
        <!--<a href="/ideas"> &bull; Ideas&nbsp;/Inspirations </a>-->
        <a href="/tips"> &bull; Tips and Tricks </a>
        <a href="/updates"> &bull; Updates </a>
        <a href="/faq"> &bull; FAQ </a>
    </section>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav__divs nav__div1">
        <button id="menu__btn" class="menu__btn">
          <img src="/icons/menu.svg" alt="Menu" />
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="nav__divs nav__div2">
        <a href="/"> SweetDreams AI </a>
      </div>

      <div class="nav__divs nav__div3">
        <a href="/donate">
          <img src="/icons/donate.svg" alt="Donate" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- THEME LOGIC -->
    <div class="theme__choice__container">
        <button id="theme__choice" class="theme__choice">
                <img id="light__theme" style="display: none;" width="40px" height="auto" src="/icons/sun.svg" alt="☀️" />
                <img id="dark__theme" width="40px" height="auto" src="/icons/moon.svg" alt="🌙" />
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Keep the Magic Brewing</h1>
            <p>Your support helps us create more magical bedtime stories for children around the world</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-grid">
            <div class="description">
                <h2>Why Support SweetDreams AI?</h2>
                <p>SweetDreams AI was created with one simple mission: to make bedtime magical for every child. While our service is completely free, maintaining and improving it requires resources.</p>

                <p>Your donation helps us:</p>
                <ul class="impact-list">
                    <li>Keep the service free for families who can't afford paid alternatives</li>
                    <li>Develop new features and story types</li>
                    <li>Improve AI quality and response times</li>
                    <li>Cover server costs and API expenses</li>
                    <li>Create more magical moments at bedtime</li>
                </ul>

                <p>Every contribution, no matter how small, makes a huge difference in keeping the dream alive. Thank you for considering supporting our mission!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="donate-card">
                <span class="coffee-icon">
                	☕
                </span>
                <h3>Buy Me a Coffee</h3>
                <p>Support SweetDreams AI with a small donation. Every coffee helps create more magical stories and keeps the dream alive for children everywhere!</p>
                <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/devyay" class="donate-btn" target="_blank">
                   ☕️ Donate Now
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="supporters">
            <h2>Join Our Community of Dream Weavers</h2>
            <p>You're not just buying a coffee - you're becoming part of a magical community that believes in sweet dreams for all. Your support inspires us to keep building, creating, and spreading bedtime magic across the world.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

<hr class="hr__footer">
<div class="footer__div">
      <footer class="footer">
        <p>&copy; All Rights Reserved. <br>
          SweetDreams AI  &bull;  <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
        </p>
      </footer>
</div>
<script defer src="/js/donate.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
